SHORT:        Relocate 68k srcs, bins & includes.
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

(18th Jan 1993)

A small utility to copy source code from one place to another but also copy
all necessary binary includes (incbins) and includes to the destination
directory, modifying the copy of the source code to be instantly compilable.

Download it! It's only 10Kb! Mail me and tell me if you use it....

